{"asset_key":"ep2/quest_story_12232090","episode":"ep2","category":"quest_story","story_id":"12232090","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:2:1223209001:0":{"text":"흐으... 콜록... 추워...","source_cn":"嚯……嗬……好冷……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC0E985E534AB1339","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1223209002:0":{"text":"파스, 무슨 일이야? 왜 그렇게 골골 앓고 있는 거야?","source_cn":"怎么回事，帕斯，怎么跟个痨病鬼似的。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC6AA396AA63CECFE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1223209003:0":{"text":"무슨... 말도 안 되는 소리야...","source_cn":"说什么……鬼话！老子……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9B9946AE124BAAF7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1223209004:0":{"text":"이런, 똑바로 서! 넘어질 뻔했잖아!","source_cn":"喂！站稳了！怎么还摔倒了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x59485D4BAD4B3479","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1223209005:0":{"text":"나... 멀쩡한...데...!","source_cn":"老子……精神得……很！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6AD80231C72F9B7D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1223209006:0":{"text":"어디 좀 봐. 체온이 왜 이